{"id": 1, "ok": true, "cmd": "complex", "ucas": "complex (1+2i)/(3-i)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "complex", "input": "(1+2i)/(3-i)", "result": "1/10 + 7i/10", "re": "1/10", "im": "7/10"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "value", "points": 1, "max_diff": 0, "passed": true}], "files": [], "text": "(1+2i)/(3-i) = 1/10 + 7i/10\n  Re = 1/10,  Im = 7/10\n  check: equal numerically (0.1 + 0.7i, complex arithmetic)\n"}
{"id": 2, "ok": true, "cmd": "re", "ucas": "re e^(i*x)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "re", "input": "e^(i*x)", "result": "cos(x)"}, "notes": [{"kind": "rule", "text": "i is the imaginary unit; x is taken as real"}], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "sample_points", "points": 64, "max_diff": 0, "passed": true}], "files": [], "text": "  note: i is the imaginary unit; x is taken as real\nRe(e^(i*x)) = cos(x)\n  check: equal at 64 of 64 sample points\n"}
