{"id": 22, "ok": true, "cmd": "nthroots", "ucas": "nthroots 3 8", "structured": false, "result": {"text": "the 3 cube roots of 8 (w^3 = 8)\n  w0 = 2                      = 2  (principal)\n  w1 = -1 + i*sqrt(3)         = 2*e^(i*2pi/3)\n  w2 = -1 - i*sqrt(3)         = 2*e^(-i*2pi/3)\n  check: each w^3, parsed back as printed, equals 8 numerically\n"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "the 3 cube roots of 8 (w^3 = 8)\n  w0 = 2                      = 2  (principal)\n  w1 = -1 + i*sqrt(3)         = 2*e^(i*2pi/3)\n  w2 = -1 - i*sqrt(3)         = 2*e^(-i*2pi/3)\n  check: each w^3, parsed back as printed, equals 8 numerically\n"}
